# The two brand reference boards at the repo root, named rather than globbed.
#
# This was `*.png`, which uses gitignore semantics: unanchored, so it matched at EVERY depth.
# The moment apps/web/public/icons/*.png and app/apple-icon.png existed, that one line would
# have quietly stripped every icon out of the deploy — a favicon that works locally and is
# absent in production, with nothing to point at.
#
# Only applies to CLI uploads anyway; a git-triggered build clones the whole repo. Kept
# narrow so it cannot cause the same surprise twice.
/Brand Info Concepts.png
/Brand Info Concepts 2.png
